OL,3,GNEWSAShould fireworks lose their bang?
OL,4,
OL,5,FFor some, it is the highlight of
OL,6,Fautumn: a crisp night, a crackling
OL,7,Fbonfire and a sky full of colour.
OL,9,FFor others, it means weeks of anxious
OL,10,Fpets, sleepless nights and bangs that
OL,11,Fcome without warning.
OL,13,FNow a growing number of people want
OL,14,Ffireworks to lose their bang, and some
OL,15,Fdisplays are already swapping
OL,16,Fexplosions for quieter alternatives
OL,17,Flike lasers.
OL,19,FBut traditionalists say a fireworks
OL,20,Fnight without the noise just isn't the
OL,21,Fsame.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
